# Storage

## Do

- Store retrospective artifacts under `data/retrospectives/{retroId}/` (feedback, analysis, actions, report).
- Validate retro, feedback, and action IDs before building paths.
- Use atomic write patterns in `file-storage.service.js`.

## Do not

- Build storage paths from unvalidated user input (no path traversal).
- Use ad-hoc `fs` path construction outside the storage service.
- Add a database or Google Drive integration in core app code (Drive is MCP-only from the parent repo).
